#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvdpau.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The VDPAU driver suitable for the hardware in your system: <xref "
"linkend='libvdpau-va-gl'/> (for Intel GPUs) and <xref linkend='mesa'/> "
"(providing the <literal>r600</literal>, <literal>radeonsi</literal>, and "
"<literal>nouveau</literal> VDPAU drivers, for the ATI/AMD Radeon HD 2xxx "
"GPUs and later, and <ulink "
"url='https://nouveau.freedesktop.org/VideoAcceleration.html'> supported "
"NVIDIA GPUs</ulink>; Mesa must be built after this package for these "
"drivers)"
msgstr ""
"O controlador VDPAU adequado para o hardware em teu sistema: <xref "
"linkend='libvdpau-va-gl'/> (para GPUs da Intel) e <xref linkend='mesa'/> "
"(fornecendo os controladores VDPAU <literal>r600</literal> , "
"<literal>radeonsi</literal> e <literal>nouveau</literal>, para as GPUs "
"Radeon HD 2xxx e posteriores da ATI/AMD, e <ulink "
"url='https://nouveau.freedesktop.org/VideoAcceleration.html'>GPUs suportadas"
" da NVIDIA</ulink>; o Mesa precisa ser construído depois desse pacote para "
"esses controladores)"

